    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u26a0\ufe0f\u2757\u2757 Important Notice: Location Permission Pop-Up \u2757\u2757\u26a0\ufe0f</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your continued support! We\u2019ve recently received a few reports about a location permission pop-up appearing in our games. If you see this prompt, feel free to <u><i><strong>decline it</strong></i></u>. The game should work just fine without needing any location data. Rest assured, we haven\u2019t programmed our games to request location access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively looking into what\u2019s causing this. For context, our games are built using the Construct 3 engine, which relies on HTML5 technology, and this might be related to the issue. One possibility (though we\u2019re not certain yet) is that a recent Windows update could be triggering these prompts for web-based applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter this pop-up, we\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could take a screenshot and send it to us at <u>ub@noobzilla.games</u>. Your help will go a long way in helping us resolve this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding, and we apologize for any inconvenience. We truly value your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best regards,<br><br>UB</p></p><br><h1>\ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a MORE UPCOMING GAMES! \ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.poster.avif?t=1751632202\" width=800 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.webm?t=1751632202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><table><tr><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.poster.avif?t=1751632202\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.webm?t=1751632202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.mp4?t=1751632202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is the second title of <strong>Cats and Seek</strong> series.<br>Hi, this time we're going to follow John and Emily on a date to Dino Park. Turns out, not only are there lots of dinosaurs, but there are also many cats playing and hiding there! Let's play hide and seek with the cats in Dino Park!<br>\u2764\ufe0f \u200a\u200a\u200a\u200aCan you find them all?  \u2764\ufe0f <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/22f165062db166bd0bc9fb84a72f2ffa.poster.avif?t=1751632202\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/22f165062db166bd0bc9fb84a72f2ffa.webm?t=1751632202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/2ad2ef60c4b7dd3d10bc5c17f528b46a.poster.avif?t=1751632202\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729000/extras/2ad2ef60c4b7dd3d10bc5c17f528b46a.webm?t=1751632202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">